{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2019-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1561939200, "end_date": 1562543999, "month_true_total": 244, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:16:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "53947494", "author": {"steamid": "76561198164579093", "personaname": "Evilous", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/glitchverse/", "num_games_owned": 307, "num_reviews": 137, "playtime_forever": 35, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 35, "last_played": 1561930609, "avatar": "f36b9c20510341651e36a5359b1e12b732af87c2"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a roguelite that has sold over 1 million copies on steam\nThe game is not that fun\nJust image a game where the worst class in the game is only only one you have and the gameplay is boring.\nUnlocking stuff takes way too long. In all my time I killed the first boss twice and went to the second area and only unlocked one item.\nBosses and enemies are just given high damage and health but they have no real diffuculty when you can just jump over them. The AI is very stupid and it is easy to get away from them and kill them from a distance.\nNone of the deaths feel deserved unless you jump in the crowds. \nThe game is step up for speed running it (With the longer you take the harder it gets) but then you have to wait 90 seconds and kill all enemies that spawn with the boss.\nMost people say the game is good for the multiplayer but it is dead since risk of rain 2 is out.\nI would say buy the second one since this game is abandoned", "timestamp_created": 1562535498, "timestamp_updated": 1562535498, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.099062599241733551", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "react